.TH "TODOPRO SCRATCHPAD" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro scratchpad Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-scratchpad \- Scratchpad operations — list, create,...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro scratchpad
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scratchpad operations — list, create, update, … (remote-only)
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlist\fP
  List scratchpads in a project.
  See \fBtodopro scratchpad-list(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlist\fP command.
.PP
\fBget\fP
  Get a scratchpad by ID.
  See \fBtodopro scratchpad-get(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBget\fP command.
.PP
\fBcreate\fP
  Create a new scratchpad within a project.
  See \fBtodopro scratchpad-create(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBcreate\fP command.
.PP
\fBupdate\fP
  Update a scratchpad's title and/or content.
  See \fBtodopro scratchpad-update(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBupdate\fP command.
.PP
\fBdelete\fP
  Delete a scratchpad.
  See \fBtodopro scratchpad-delete(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBdelete\fP command.
